  "reason": "Current evidence identifies multimodal multiprofile PCA with avgpool and concat as the strongest direction: config_018 has 0.619 accuracy and 0.610 F1, while config_024 has slightly higher accuracy but lower F1. The accuracy difference is small, and F1 slightly favors the resnet50 setting. Fusion strategy is still untested in this promising multimodal region. config_019 changes only fusion from concat to weighted relative to config_018, isolating whether weighted fusion can improve the already strong RNA+image pipeline. This is the best next experiment because it exploits the best-supported direction, tests an important unexplored design choice, and may either find a new best configuration or confirm that concat is sufficient."
